test "rank1930: a copy-permission tester consulted in a sibling function is not credited"
  lang python
  file hooks.py
  profile library
  expect VYQL-AUTH-002
  code
  ```
  from wagtail.models import Page


  def copy(request, page_id):
      page = Page.objects.get(id=page_id)
      return page


  def page_copy_menu_item(request, page):
      return page.permissions_for_user(request.user).can_copy()
  ```
